# The log: a commit's changes, two commits compared (A B, A...B), the changes of a range
Output demo/gifs/log.gif
Source demo/tapes/settings.tape

Hide
Type "source demo/env/setup.sh log && clear"
Enter
Type "nvim"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type ":DiffMerge log"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait+Screen /git log --branches/
Sleep 2s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "j"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "k"
Sleep 1s
Type "m"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "j"
Sleep 800ms
Type "m"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 3s
Type "M"
Sleep 1s
Type "jj"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "V"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
